{"id":"vod_md_2972","vodId":"2972","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"GJ部","name_cn":"GJ部","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230822-1/93e5ad2d1e78cd6b664eccff4792e8c8.jpg"},"summary":"GJ部到底是干什么的？可能身为部长的天使真央（内田真礼 配音）自己都说不太清楚，真央唯一可以确定的是，欺负社员四之宫京夜（下野紘 配音），让其穿上女装是部活中非常重要的一个环节。个性温柔无害惟独对自己的体重耿耿于怀的天使惠（宫本侑芽 配音），外表成熟稳重但内心十分孩子气的皇紫音（三森玲子 配音），沉默寡言对肉类食物情有独钟的绮罗罗伯恩斯坦（荒川千佳 配音）和刚刚入部，对部里的一切都懵懂好奇的神无月环（上坂堇 配音），GJ部因为有了这些可爱的女孩子们而散发出了耀眼的光芒。今天的部活又会发生什么有趣的事情呢？让我们拭目以待吧！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-22 08:59:06","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/VxwGANv9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/O2Q3JG7J/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/jwFJxirx/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/WXWaPRua/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/1qTcNwKG/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/One0i4yQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/Sblog8j7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/qmy4w5RE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/asw4xlvc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/ERbBjmXe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/SRMDTIZ4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230820/2YGTM01O/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:34:42.904Z"}